.env
# Any .env variant: backups, per-machine copies, .env.local. Bare `.env` does
# not match `.env.bak-*`, so a routine backup lands untracked-but-committable
# in a public repo. Keep the example, which carries no secrets.
.env.*
!.env.example
*.log
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/
.venv/
audit.log
drafts.log
# Generated MCP bundle (uploaded to GitHub Releases, not tracked in git)
*.mcpb
